{
  "behaviorChanges": [
    "ruff 0.15.21 -> 0.16.2 for local and CI linting. No adopter-visible behaviour changes: the linter is a dev dependency and no rule selection changed.",
    "Verified before taking rather than after: both versions report All checks passed on the linted tree, and both count 6443 E501 hits over LINT_PATHS -- measured with the ratchet's own invocation, and exactly its E501_BASELINE, so the pin moves it by zero. A linter behaviour change there would have moved a ratchet silently instead of failing loudly, which is the only way this bump could bite."
  ],
